# F10 > Report a problem > Send on GitHub (with the copy of the page unticked): the issue opens with the page's address in its
# title and the description, address and log in its body. No copy of the page was asked for,
# so the body asks for no file.
pages/double-click-rows.html
start:css=#file1
key:Enter
key:F10
key:ArrowDown*3
key:Enter
report
report-send:Enter on a row did not open the file
report-has:^title: Problem on file:///.*double-click-rows\.html: Enter on a row did not open the file$
report-has:^### What happened$
report-has:^### Page$
report-has:enter on=.*second=false
report-lacks:Copy of the page
report-lacks:Report\.docx
